  "description": "RIYQOJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C58 H115 Cr3 Dy3 F1 N4 O26,C2 H3 N1,H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Cr1 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr2 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors; Cr3 (Cr) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.312-4.030 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.97-113.51°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Dy3Cr3FC60H120N5O27. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 3 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
